<back-navbar style="height: {{navBarHeight}}rpx;" title="增加订单额度" avatar="/images/back-gray.png" bindnavbuttontap="toBack"></back-navbar>

<view class="page" style="padding-top: {{navBarHeight}}rpx;">
  <view class="balance-card">
    <view>
      <text class="eyebrow">当前可用订单处理额度</text>
      <view class="balance">{{account.availableQuantity || 0}}<text> 条</text></view>
    </view>
    <view class="balance-meta">
      <text>累计授予 {{account.grantedQuantity || 0}}</text>
      <text>累计消费 {{account.consumedQuantity || 0}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">
    <text>选择加量方案</text>
    <text class="section-note">价格与赠送以当前活动接口为准</text>
  </view>

  <scroll-view wx:if="{{offers.length}}" scroll-x class="offer-scroll" enhanced show-scrollbar="false">
    <view class="offer-row">
      <view class="offer-card {{selectedIndex == index ? 'selected' : ''}}"
        wx:for="{{offers}}" wx:key="offerCode" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="selectOffer">
        <text wx:if="{{item.activityLabel}}" class="activity-label">{{item.activityLabel}}</text>
        <text class="offer-quantity">{{item.quantityText}}</text>
        <view class="price"><text>¥</text>{{item.amountText}}</view>
        <text wx:if="{{item.hasDiscount}}" class="original-price">原价 ¥{{item.originalAmountText}}</text>
        <text class="unit-price">{{item.unitPriceFen}} 分/条</text>
        <view wx:if="{{item.hasBonus}}" class="bonus">含赠送 {{item.bonusText}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
  <view wx:elif="{{!loading}}" class="empty-card">当前暂无可购买的加量活动，请稍后再试。</view>

  <view wx:if="{{selectedOffer}}" class="offer-detail">
    <view class="detail-line"><text>基础额度</text><text>{{selectedOffer.baseText}}</text></view>
    <view class="detail-line"><text>活动赠送</text><text>{{selectedOffer.bonusText}}</text></view>
    <view class="detail-line"><text>到账合计</text><text class="strong">{{selectedOffer.quantityText}}</text></view>
    <view class="detail-line"><text>有效期</text><text>{{selectedOffer.validityText}}</text></view>
    <text wx:if="{{selectedOffer.activityCopy}}" class="activity-copy">{{selectedOffer.activityCopy}}</text>
    <button class="purchase-button" loading="{{paying}}" disabled="{{paying}}" bindtap="purchaseSelected">
      {{paying ? '正在处理' : selectedOffer.purchaseButtonText}}
    </button>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title"><text>订单额度说明</text></view>
  <view class="intro-card">
    <view class="intro-item"><text class="intro-title">灵活加量</text><text>无需改变当前商业套餐，可根据订单量单独购买适合的处理额度。</text></view>
    <view class="intro-item"><text class="intro-title">阶梯优惠与期间活动</text><text>不同期间可以配置不同售价和赠送数量，页面展示以当前有效活动为准。</text></view>
    <view class="intro-item"><text class="intro-title">按实际业务量消费</text><text>一条订单商品行第一次正式完成履约时消费 1 条，不按页面点击次数扣减。</text></view>
    <view class="intro-item"><text class="intro-title">打印不会重复消费</text><text>打印、补打、重新打印，以及语音识别本身，都不会减少 ORDER_LINE。</text></view>
    <view class="intro-item"><text class="intro-title">活动赠送公开透明</text><text>基础购买与活动赠送会分别进入额度流水，后续可随时核对。</text></view>
    <view class="intro-item"><text class="intro-title">套餐与额度相互独立</text><text>商业套餐决定能使用哪些功能；这里购买的额度只增加可处理的订单商品行数量。</text></view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{orders.length}}" class="section-title"><text>最近购买记录</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{orders.length}}" class="history-card">
    <view class="history-row" wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="orderNo">
      <view class="history-copy">
        <text class="history-name">{{item.productName}}</text>
        <text>{{item.quantityText}} · ¥{{item.amountText}}</text>
        <text>{{item.createdText}}</text>
      </view>
      <text class="history-status {{item.paid ? 'paid' : ''}}">{{item.statusName}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="safe-tip">支付订单与 Usage 流水均保留审计记录；前端不会根据支付金额自行换算额度。</view>
</view>
